{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144290/extras/1ee500057d0921002f93b9f1921f2e24.webp?t=1595639119\" width=319 height=47 /></span><br>Nina is so full of problems that she barely recognizes herself.<br>Try to understand her world, views and beliefs from her perspective and guide her through her dreams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144290/extras/d26952b7243f5fa56d3c0cecfadb3912.webp?t=1595639119\" width=319 height=47 /></span><br>Through perception, observation, trial and error, help a poor girl find out what's happening in her mind. Guide her through the seven doors around her bed and find a way to comprehend what they mean. Don't neglect anything: every object may contain a piece of crucial information.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144290/extras/4837923ebefb57a893147c11aa2a674b.webp?t=1595639119\" width=319 height=47 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story Driven Narrative: This game is a story that needs to be told. There aren't fights other than Nina's.<br></li><li>Another Way of Horror: Lucid Nina isn't about jumpscares, but interpreting dreams and helping one girl along the way.<br></li><li>Focus on Exploration: In a simple and intuitive &quot;move-and-interact&quot; gameplay, don't let anything go unnoticed. Clues are essential in Lucid Nina.</li></ul><br>Gameplay Time: Estimated to be around 30 minutes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144290/extras/e8b8794b785fd8f265276724faa82c9d.webp?t=1595639119\" width=319 height=47 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arrow Keys: Move<br></li><li>Enter/Z: Confirm &amp; Interact<br></li><li>Esc/X: Cancel &amp; Menu<br><